+RESULT
+Traceback (most recent call last):
+  File "<stdin>", line 4, in <module>
+  File "/reference/tools/klean_preflight.py", line 582, in check_generation
+    raise KleanPreflightError(
+tools.klean_preflight.KleanPreflightError: lake clean failed (1): error: could not detect the configuration of the Lake installation
+
+EXIT CODE
+1
+
+DIAGNOSIS
+The sandbox reports a namespace PID from getpid(), but its /proc mount has no
+/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe. Lean 4.22 calls readlink on that numeric path to
+locate its installation. See lean-environment-workaround.txt. The successful
+rerun used proc-self-readlink.c, which maps only /proc/<digits>/exe to the
+equivalent /proc/self/exe path.
diff --git a/evidence/proc-self-readlink.c b/evidence/proc-self-readlink.c
